<item><title>Burkina Faso restarts Perkoa mine after four years idle</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-restarts-perkoa-mine-after-four-years-idle-eadcc5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-restarts-perkoa-mine-after-four-years-idle-eadcc5/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The state mining company has resumed operations at the polymetallic site, closed since April 2022 after underground flooding killed eight workers.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:16:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-restarts-perkoa-mine-after-four-years-idle-eadcc5/share.jpg" length="41659" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-restarts-perkoa-mine-after-four-years-idle-eadcc5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso, Mali and Niger approve digital cooperation framework</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-mali-and-niger-approve-digital-cooperation-bea231/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-mali-and-niger-approve-digital-cooperation-bea231/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The agreement covers connected networks, postal services and cybersecurity, with diplomatic review and leaders’ approval still ahead.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:13:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
