<item><title>Burkina Faso mini-dairies seek role in public milk initiatives</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-mini-dairies-seek-role-in-public-milk-607008/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-mini-dairies-seek-role-in-public-milk-607008/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The network collected 1 838 849 litres of local milk and reported more than CFA1.3 billion in revenue in 2025.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:01:03 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso opens Kadiogo fish fair to connect producers with urban buyers</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-opens-kadiogo-fish-fair-to-connect-producers-ebe1ce/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-opens-kadiogo-fish-fair-to-connect-producers-ebe1ce/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The 26-28 November event in Koubri features fish sales, panels and business meetings for local producers and processors.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:29:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
